      <activity id="25459e7c-913c-5354-a202-283b8f2d28a8" activityNameId="101900f9-22e0-5b9b-a165-e41dae0c46de" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">xx Wind power plant 800kW, moving parts</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: xx Wind power plant 800kW, moving parts
Lifetime is assumed to be 20 years. Annual electricity production is assumed to be about 1.4 GWh. Data are from a Nordex N50/800 plant.;
UUID: fdb5737a-6c7f-3ae3-b0c2-d14e16df5959
Includes materials used for moving parts: rotor, nacelle, electric parts, and their disposal. Also includes the prozessing, the energy requirements for assembling, the transports needed, and  the connection to the grid.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Average European technology for a 800 kW wind power plant.
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Literature 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_fdb5737a-6c7f-3ae3-b0c2-d14e16df5959.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
